            "behavior": "- `list`: rows with icon, label, description and a chevron, hairlines between them.\n- `chips`: outlined pill buttons in document order, wrapping to more lines; descriptions are not shown.\n- Picking an option runs its action once. The picked option stays marked and the others are disabled, so the transcript shows what was chosen.",
